# Generated brand assets are compared against a freshly rendered copy by
# `pnpm brand:check`, which renders LF. Pin SVGs to LF so a CRLF checkout does
# not rewrite them. (The check also normalizes line endings before comparing,
# so a stray global core.autocrlf still can't produce a phantom failure — this
# keeps the committed bytes clean, the normalization keeps the check honest.)
*.svg text eol=lf

# Never let CRLF conversion or diff heuristics touch generated binaries.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
